WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.212
Volume tells us how much space a box takes up. We count it in cubes.

00:06.662 --> 00:13.916
Say a box is four cubes long and three cubes wide. One layer on the bottom has four times three,

00:13.916 --> 00:15.579
which is twelve cubes.

00:16.029 --> 00:21.462
Now say the box is two cubes tall. That means two layers of twelve.

00:21.912 --> 00:27.903
Twelve plus twelve is twenty-four. Or multiply the three numbers together.

00:28.353 --> 00:31.975
So the volume is length times width times height.
